    "README: M toggles map/external view.",
    "README: left HUD box lists carried objects with arrow-key scrolling.",
    "R.EXE references SAVE%02d.pcx, SAVE%d.dat, REPLAY%d.PCX, RESTART, hud3.pcx, hudoff.pcx, hudmes.dat and objhud.dat.",
    "R.EXE contains Saving Game.... and Loading Game.... strings."
